<title>UK: UK Oftel hires new service, international director.</title>
<headline>UK Oftel hires new service, international director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's telecommunications industry regulator Oftel said on Tuesday it had appointed a new director of services competition and international affairs.</p>
<p>In a statement the regulator said Jim Niblett would replace Caroline Varley, who is taking up a post with the International Energy Agency in Paris.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
